<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 312 FOR FOUR DECLARED.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 312 FOR FOUR DECLARED.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, leading on first innings by 27 runs, declared their second innings on 312 for four on the fourth day of the second cricket test against West Indies at the Sydney Cricket Ground on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 331 (Greg Blewett 69) and 312 for four declared (Matthew Elliott 78 retired hurt, Mark Waugh 67); West Indies 304 (Sherwin Campbell 77).</p>
